  {
   "text": "Le Chatelier's principle: a system at equilibrium shifts to",
   "box": [
    0.0882,
    0.1357,
    0.5686,
    0.017
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "oppose any change in concentration, temperature or pressure.",
